## Mô Hình Dữ Liệu (ERD)

```
AppUser         ──< AuditLog
AppUser         ──< OrderRequest (Editor quản lý)
AppUser         ──< AffiliateApplication
Role            >── AppUser (Many-to-Many)

ServiceCategory ──< ServicePlan
ServicePlan     ──< PlanPrice (tháng/năm)
ServicePlan     ──  Promotion (khuyến mãi)
ServicePlan     ──  QrCode (sinh mã QR)

NewsArticle     (Category: hướng dẫn/khuyến mãi/thông báo)
OrderRequest    (trạng thái: Mới → Đang xử lý → Hoàn tất/Từ chối)
AffiliateApplication
```

### Các Entity chính:

| Entity | Các trường quan trọng |
|---|---|
| `ServiceCategory` | Id, Name, Slug, Description, Icon, IsActive |
| `ServicePlan` | Id, CategoryId, Name, Slug, Specs(CPU/RAM/SSD/BW), Description, QrCodeUrl, IsActive |
| `PlanPrice` | Id, PlanId, BillingCycle(Monthly/Yearly), Price, OriginalPrice |
| `Promotion` | Id, PlanId, DiscountPercent, StartDate, EndDate, IsActive |
| `NewsArticle` | Id, Title, Slug, Content, Category, AuthorId, PublishedAt, IsPublished |
| `OrderRequest` | Id, CustomerId?, ServiceName, PlanId, BillingCycle, CustomerName, Email, Phone, Status, CreatedAt |
| `AffiliateApplication` | Id, FullName, Email, Phone, Company, Website, Status |
| `AppUser` | Id, Username, Email, PasswordHash, Role, CreatedAt |
| `AuditLog` | Id, UserId, Action, EntityType, EntityId, OldValue, NewValue, Timestamp |

